'''Mienfoo''' (Japanese: '''コジョフー''' ''Kojofu'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

