==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Mienfoo|56}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*'''Kick Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Hoothoot|85}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

